@base = http://localhost:3000
@userId = 4

### Health check
GET {{base}}/health

### Portfolio del usuario 1 (seed: valor total 889756.00)
GET {{base}}/users/1/portfolio

### Búsqueda: ticker o nombre (q)
GET {{base}}/instruments/search?q=gal

### Búsqueda: por nombre, paginada
GET {{base}}/instruments/search?name=banco&limit=5&offset=0

### Búsqueda: ticker y nombre combinados (AND)
GET {{base}}/instruments/search?ticker=b&name=macro

### 1. Transferencia entrante (CASH_IN, pesos enteros)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "side": "CASH_IN", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 100000 }

### 2. Compra MARKET por cantidad (se ejecuta al último close -> FILLED)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 10 }

### 3. Compra MARKET por monto en pesos (floor(5000 / 229.50) = 21 unidades)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "amount": "5000" }

### 4. Compra LIMIT (queda NEW y reserva size * price)
# @name limitOrder
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 54, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 10, "price": "200" }

### 5. Portfolio con la reserva de la LIMIT
GET {{base}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio

### 6. Cancelar la orden LIMIT anterior (solo órdenes NEW)
POST {{base}}/orders/{{limitOrder.response.body.id}}/cancel

### 7. Venta MARKET
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 5 }

### 8. Transferencia saliente (CASH_OUT)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "side": "CASH_OUT", "type": "MARKET", "amount": 1000 }

### 9. Fondos insuficientes -> 201 con status REJECTED (queda persistida)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "MARKET", "size": 1000 }

### 10. Unidades insuficientes -> 201 con status REJECTED
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "SELL", "type": "MARKET", "size": 999 }

### 11. Request inválido -> 400 (LIMIT sin precio, no se persiste)
POST {{base}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "userId": {{userId}}, "instrumentId": 47, "side": "BUY", "type": "LIMIT", "size": 1 }

### 12. Portfolio final
GET {{base}}/users/{{userId}}/portfolio
